  "entity": "HCMv3.TimeManagement.RosterDutySchedule",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>A roster schedule: a duty period with a start point and holiday calendar, meant for generating roster daily duties.</p><p>Not read at present: the time engine and payroll take employees' duties from duty periods and roster groups, not from this list. The roster generator that would have used it was never live in the legacy system and was not ported.</p>",
